    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000009" id="RXEX_BI_k" name="rate for rivaroxaban metabolite export in bile" value="0.17953060417325" units="per_min" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Biliary excretion of the metabolites: of an oral solution of 10 mg
[14C]rivaroxaban 65.7 % of the dose are recovered in the urine (36 %
unchanged) and 28.0 % in the feces (7 % unchanged), i.e. about 30 % of
the dose are metabolites in the urine and 21 % in the feces
(Weinz2009).</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
